              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Issue #981 (pa-r17-003): in v0.17, the & (address-of) operator is limited to function symbols only. Taking the address of a data symbol (let-bound variable, constant, or array) is not yet supported. Use &function_name only. Issue #992 (pa-r17-014): addends in lea [rip + sym + addend] must fit in i32; offsets for record fields must not exceed i32::MAX (0x7FFFFFFF)."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/T0536",
