              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Issue #1013 (T0558 retroactive guard): A Let binding has a declared [u8; N] array type annotation, but the actual bytes from the @guid or @include_bytes directive differ in length. Either fix the type annotation to match the actual size, or fix the directive to produce the correct number of bytes. This guard prevents silent data truncation or padding mismatches."
