              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Issue #1210: An integer-scrutinee match expression is missing an explicit\ndefault arm. All integer-scrutinee matches require a `_ =>` arm to handle\nvalues that do not match any literal pattern. Add a default arm to handle\nthe fallback case. Example: `match x { 1u64 => ..., _ => ... }`.\n"
