              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "During field-access elaboration, a field_index from FieldAccessInfo was used\nto index into the record layout's fields array, but the index exceeded the\narray's length. This indicates an invariant violation: either the field_index\nis corrupt, or the record layout was incompletely registered.\n\nIssue #1147 slice A4 migration from the legacy Vec<String> diagnostic channel\nto the typed pipe.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/U1646",
