                "text": "FieldAccessInfo.field_index exceeds record_layout.fields length"
              }
            },
            {
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "During field-assignment lowering ((*p).field = value), the elaborator\nattempted to resolve a local binding name (for either the pointer receiver p\nor the RHS value Var) but the binding was not found in the local_bindings map.\nThis can occur when:\n- The pointer receiver binding has not been declared in the enclosing function\n- The RHS Var binding has not been declared or has gone out of scope\n- The resolve_var_operands pass failed to populate local_bindings\n\nIssue #1147 slice A4 migration from the legacy Vec<String> diagnostic channel\nto the typed pipe.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/U1647",
              "id": "U1647",
              "name": "Field-assign operand not resolvable via local_bindings",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "pointer receiver or RHS Var missing from local_bindings map"
              }
            },
            {
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "During enum constructor or discriminant lowering, the elaborator attempted to\nlook up required metadata but the entry was not found in the side-table. This\ncan occur when:\n- EnumCons node lacks EnumConsInfo in the side-table\n- EnumCons has payload_size > 0 but no payload child\n- EnumDiscriminant node lacks EnumTypeId in the side-table\n\nIssue #1147 slice A5a migration from the legacy Vec<String> diagnostic channel\nto the typed pipe. This indicates a structural invariant violation in the\nelaborator and should not occur in normal compilation.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/U1648",
