              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "During enum constructor, discriminant, or match lowering, the elaborator\nattempted to look up the enum layout for a type_id but the layout was not\nfound in the state's enum_layouts table. This can occur when:\n- An enum type was not properly registered during elaboration\n- The type_id is invalid or uninitialized\n- The layout was removed prematurely from the state\n\nIssue #1147 slice A5a migration from the legacy Vec<String> diagnostic channel\nto the typed pipe. This indicates a structural invariant violation and should\nnot occur in normal compilation.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/U1649",
