            {
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "During match expression lowering, a Match IR node was found to be malformed:\n- Missing children (expected at least scrutinee)\n- Missing arms in jump-table or cascade dispatch\n- Scrutinee type not resolvable from the node structure\n- Insufficient arms for exhaustive pattern coverage\n\nIssue #1147 slice A5a migration from the legacy Vec<String> diagnostic channel\nto the typed pipe. This indicates a post-elaboration invariant violation: either\nthe parser/lowerer produced a malformed Match, or child-transfer passed through\nwithout validating the shape.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/U1650",
