              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "During match arm lowering (either jump-table or cascade dispatch), the\nelaborator attempted to look up match-arm metadata but the entry was not found\nin the arena's match_arm_meta side-table. Each arm must have associated\nMatchArmMeta describing its pattern bindings and layout.\n\nIssue #1147 slice A5a migration from the legacy Vec<String> diagnostic channel\nto the typed pipe. This indicates a structural invariant violation: the arm\nwas not properly registered during elaboration.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/U1651",
