            },
            {
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "During nested pattern binding lowering (in lower_pattern for record fields),\nthe elaborator attempted to resolve a field name to its index in the record\nlayout but the field was not found. This can occur when:\n- The field name does not exist in the record type definition\n- The record layout was incompletely populated\n- The field name spelling does not match the layout's field index\n\nIssue #1147 slice A5a migration from the legacy Vec<String> diagnostic channel\nto the typed pipe. This indicates a structural invariant violation or type\nmismatch in the record field resolution.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/U1653",
              "id": "U1653",
              "name": "Nested-pattern field name not in record layout",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "field_index_by_name returned None during nested pattern lowering"
              }
            },
            {
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "During nested pattern binding lowering (in lower_pattern), the elaborator\nattempted to assign binding slots but exhausted the available scratch\nregisters. Two forms:\n- Memory-form patterns: each binding requires a scratch register; limit is 5\n  (scratch_regs array length). Exceeding 5 bindings per arm exhausts the pool.\n- Register-form patterns: limit is 4 caller-save registers. Exceeding 4\n  bindings per arm triggers this diagnostic.\n\nIssue #1147 slice A5a migration from the legacy Vec<String> diagnostic channel\nto the typed pipe. Workaround: restructure nested patterns to use fewer than\n5 (memory) or 4 (register) bindings per arm.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/U1654",
              "id": "U1654",
              "name": "Nested-pattern leaf-binding count exceeded scratch pool",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": ">5 leaves in arm (memory path) / >4 leaves in arm (register path)"
              }
            },
            {
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "During arm-body lowering, the elaborator expected an App node to have at\nleast 3 children (callee, arg0, arg1) and for all to be present in the\narena. One or more conditions failed:\n- App node has fewer than 3 children\n- Callee child ID is not in the arena\n- Arg0 (first argument) child ID is not in the arena\n- Arg1 (second argument) child ID is not in the arena\n\nIssue #1147 slice A5b migration from the legacy Vec<String> diagnostic channel\nto the typed pipe.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/U1655",
              "id": "U1655",
              "name": "App node arm-body shape violation",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "App node < 3 children or callee/arg child missing from arena"
              }
            },
            {
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "During arm-body lowering, the elaborator attempted to lower an App node's\noperands but found that the corresponding side-table entry was missing:\n- For Var operands: binding_names side-table has no entry for the variable\n- For Literal operands: literal_values side-table has no entry for the literal\n\nThis indicates an inconsistency in the IR: the operand is registered but not\nindexed in the side-table used to extract its value during lowering.\n\nIssue #1147 slice A5b migration from the legacy Vec<String> diagnostic channel\nto the typed pipe.\n"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://paideia-os.org/diagnostics/U1656",
              "id": "U1656",
              "name": "App node operand arena side-table miss",
              "shortDescription": {
